Error [E0118]: `held` in this pattern would make a new `held`, but `held` already holds a value
  --> pattern_test_reuse_and_operand.jet:19:42
    |
 19 |     same :: ready && parse("abc") == .Ok(held)
    |                                          ^^^^
 Why: A pattern test introduces the names in its pattern; it does not compare with an existing value
 Fix: Pick a new name to bind (`_` if unused); to compare, test the pattern in an `if` condition and compare the bound name there: `if subject == .Case(found) && found == held`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
